Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790067599999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790035199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The strongest counterargument: the largest single directional move in the window is the opening 12-bar, ~36% bear leg to 1368.42, so the bull-trend label rests only on the last ~34 bars, and the 73 bars before that are balance, not trend.", "The 27 bars ahead of the final push are a two-sided range (2357.18-2680) with heavy overlap and mid-range closes; 2850 is a first-bar probe only 79.00 above 2771, and single-bar breakouts of multi-week range tops often fail and re-enter the range.", "Bar 1787270400000 (445.69 range, close 2515.30, ~255.70 upper tail) followed by a 27-bar stall is spike-high behavior consistent with a temporary exhaustion and a market capped by a range boundary rather than a functioning bull channel.", "The 208.30-point final bar after an extended advance could be a buy climax; a large bull bar that is immediately retraced would mark exhaustion rather than breakout acceptance."], "evidence_for": ["A 388.17-point bull trend bar (1787097600000) closed at 2252.16, 89% of its range and above the 73-bar range top 1974.46, with immediate follow-through to 2771 two bars later.", "Successive higher swing highs across the window (1974.46, 2293.80, 2771, 2850) and higher swing lows (1368.42, 1512.91, 2357.18/2358.62).", "The 27-bar pause held entirely above the breakout bar's open 1916.51 and the old range top 1974.46; no close returned inside the 73-bar range.", "The final bar closes 2775.61 above the prior spike high 2771 and in the upper 64% of its range, with four consecutive rising closes."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["The window opens at 2109.85 (close of 1779667200000) after a 2139.34 high, then declines 13 bars to 1368.42 (low of 1780704000000), about 36% below 2139.34.", "Bar 1780704000000 has a 230.85 range with a 200.13 lower tail and closes at 1568.55 (top ~13% of its range); bar 1780790400000 (open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83) is a bull reversal bar closing at its high.", "From 1780790400000 to 1787011200000 (73 bars) price overlaps repeatedly between 1512.91 (low of 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high of 1785110400000); closes cluster 1550-1950 with many overlapping bodies and mixed closes (two-sided range).", "Bar 1787097600000 breaks out: open 1916.51, high 2293.80, low 1905.63, close 2252.16, a 388.17-point bull trend bar closing in the top ~11% of its range and above the 1974.46 range top.", "Bar 1787270400000 spikes to 2771 with a 445.69 range, closing 2515.30 and leaving a ~255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 1787184000000 through 1789603200000 (27 bars) stay between 2357.18 (low of 1788307200000) and 2680 (high of 1789084800000); bodies overlap and closes sit mostly 2380-2530.", "The last four closes are 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, 2775.61; the final bar (open 2642.90, high 2850, low 2641.70, close 2775.61) closes above the prior spike high 2771 in the upper 64% of its 208.30-point range."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear leg of 13 bars from the window high 2139.34 into the 1368.42 low of 1780704000000; bar ranges expand into the low and that bar closes 1568.55 with a 200.13 lower tail, followed by a bull reversal bar at 1687.83.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779667200000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "73-bar two-sided range from 1780790400000 to 1787011200000; repeated overlap between 1512.91 and 1974.46 with a slight upward tilt after the 1512.91 low, many inside bars and closes in the middle of the range.", "end_time_ms": 1787183999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike escaping the 73-bar range: bar 1787097600000 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16 above the 1974.46 range top, with follow-through to the 2771 spike high of 1787270400000.", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike pause of 27 bars between the 2357.18 low of 1788307200000 and the 2680 high of 1789084800000; most highs sit 2520-2560 with probes to 2680 and most lows 2357-2440, heavy body overlap and mid-range closes.", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787184000000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Final bull leg from the 2358.62 low of bar 1789430400000: 1789689600000 and 1789776000000 close 2612.02 and 2632.98, and 1789948800000 closes 2775.61 above the 2771 spike high. The breakout proper is bars 1789689600000-1789948800000.", "end_time_ms": 1790035199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: several consecutive closes holding above 2700 (high of 1789776000000) and above 2771, with higher lows above 2641.70, would confirm acceptance above the spike high and strengthen the bull-trend/breakout-spike read.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2641.70 (low of the final bar), followed by a close below 2568.16 (low of 1789862400000), would signal the breakout failed and shift the read back toward the 2357.18-2680 range.", "Range reassertion: a close back below 2357.18 with follow-through would turn the post-spike structure into a top and recast the 1787097600000 advance as a bull trap.", "Trend weakening: deeper pullbacks that overlap prior swing lows together with more bear bars closing near their lows would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range.", "Climax risk: a further outsized bull bar immediately followed by a bear bar closing near its low would argue for a buy climax rather than a sustained second leg."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790063999999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Bars 1-81 are a two-sided, heavily overlapping range of 2357.18-2680.00 containing two failed upside breakouts (bars 56 and 76), so the window's directional evidence is concentrated in only the last 40 bars.", "The current push is essentially one large bar: bars 119-120 both closed near their lows (2738.87, 2724.95) and the last close sits below bar 115's midpoint 2754.03, so acceptance of the 2700.00 breakout is not yet demonstrated.", "The advance from bar 81 is built from overlapping legs (bars 100-114 rotate back through 2568.16-2700.00), which is more channel/range-like than a clean spike-and-channel trend.", "The 2700.00 highs at bars 103 and 113 define the top of a trading range, so the current move can equally be read as a breakout attempt from a range whose two prior attempts (bars 56 and 76) reversed fully."], "evidence_for": ["Higher-high/higher-low sequence since the bar-81 low 2358.62: lows 2436.87 (bar 95), 2568.16 (bar 109), 2658.06 (bar 115); highs 2519.81 (bar 97), 2643.52 (bar 99), 2700.00 (bars 103/113), 2850.00 (bar 115).", "Bull spikes with closes near their highs at bars 56, 98, 99 and 115; bar 115 closed 2723.15 after breaking the exact 2700.00 double top, and bars 116-118 produced higher highs through 2804.59 and rising closes through 2775.61.", "The bar-81 retest of the window low held (2358.62 vs 2357.18) and every pullback since has held above its prior swing low, keeping the always-in direction up.", "Price has not re-entered the 2568.16-2700.00 consolidation: the last close 2724.95 is still above that range's 2700.00 upper boundary and the two-bar pullback is about 46% of bar 115's range."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window of 120 closed H4 bars (1788336000000-1790063999999); first open 2416.65, last close 2724.95; window low 2357.18 (bar 1) and window high 2850.00 (bar 115).", "Bars 1-7 overlap in a 2373.00-2417.80 range; bar 1 is a wide bear bar (2416.65 / 2417.80 / 2357.18 / 2379.67).", "Bar 8 is a bull spike (open 2407.48, low 2404.35, high 2509.15, close 2506.79 near its high); bars 9-13 continue to 2516.30-2537.57.", "Bar 14 reverses hard (open 2523.22, low 2436.73, close 2450.96); bars 14-55 stay inside 2411.04-2528.80 with heavy overlap and many mid-range closes.", "Bar 56 spikes 2444.19-2680.00 (close 2555.52) above that range top; bars 57-66 then consolidate 2503.25-2607.62.", "Bar 76 reaches 2609.02 (below the 2680.00 spike high) and closes 2514.07 near its low; bars 77-81 fall to 2358.62, retesting the window low 2357.18 within 1.44.", "Bars 82-99 advance with higher lows (2358.62, then 2436.87 at bar 95) and higher highs (2519.81 bar 97, 2585.50 bar 98, 2643.52 bar 99).", "Bars 100-114 consolidate between 2568.16 (bar 109) and two exact 2700.00 highs (bars 103 and 113).", "Bar 115 spikes 2658.06-2850.00 (close 2723.15), a new window high; bars 116-118 add highs 2795.00, 2770.03, 2804.59 with closes 2754.31 / 2760.51 / 2775.61.", "Bars 119-120 are two bear bars (closes 2738.87, 2724.95; low 2716.01), pulling back 88.58 from 2804.59, roughly 46% of bar 115's range, while holding above 2700.00."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Early overlap before the bar-8 spike: bodies of bars 1-7 sit inside 2373.00-2417.80, with bar 1 a wide bear bar down to 2357.18 separating itself from the group.", "end_time_ms": 1788436799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2373.00", "start_time_ms": 1788336000000, "upper_boundary": "2417.80"}, {"description": "Bar-8 bull spike out of the early range (2404.35 to 2509.15, close 2506.79 near the high), extended by bars 9-13 to 2537.57 before bar 14 reversed the leg.", "end_time_ms": 1788523199999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": null, "start_time_ms": 1788436800000, "upper_boundary": "2537.57"}, {"description": "Large mid-window trading range after the bar-14 bear reversal: bars 14-55 rotate inside 2411.04-2528.80 with heavy bar overlap and repeated mid-range closes.", "end_time_ms": 1789127999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2528.80"}, {"description": "Failed upside breakout: bar 56 spikes 2444.19-2680.00 (close 2555.52) out of the range, bars 57-66 hold a 2503.25-2607.62 consolidation, then the leg is fully reversed into the bar-81 low.", "end_time_ms": 1789268399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2503.25", "start_time_ms": 1789128000000, "upper_boundary": "2680.00"}, {"description": "Possible lower-high reversal: bars 75-76 push to 2609.02, below the 2680.00 spike high, and bar 76 closes 2514.07 near its low; bars 77-81 then decline to 2358.62, undercutting 2411.04 and retesting the window low 2357.18.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789401600000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the double-bottom area: higher lows 2436.87 (bar 95) and higher highs 2519.81 (bar 97), 2585.50 (bar 98), 2643.52 (bar 99) off the 2358.62 low.", "end_time_ms": 1789761599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2643.52"}, {"description": "Consolidation between bar 99 and bar 115: bars 100-114 stay inside 2568.16-2700.00, with 2700.00 tested exactly at bars 103 and 113.", "end_time_ms": 1789977599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2568.16", "start_time_ms": 1789761600000, "upper_boundary": "2700.00"}, {"description": "Current leg: bar 115 spikes 2658.06-2850.00 (close 2723.15) above the 2700.00 double top; bars 116-118 follow through to 2804.59 (closes 2754.31 / 2760.51 / 2775.61), then bars 119-120 pull back to 2716.01 (close 2724.95), still above 2700.00 and below bar 115's midpoint 2754.03.", "end_time_ms": 1790063999999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850.00"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull confirmation: a bar closing above 2804.59 and then a close above 2850.00 would show accepted breakout follow-through and strengthen bull-trend / breakout-spike.", "Breakout failure: a close back below 2700.00, and especially a close below bar 115's low 2658.06, would make this spike look like a failed breakout and shift the read toward trading-range / transition-unclear.", "Loss of the higher-low sequence: a close below 2568.16 (bar-109 low) would break the sequence of higher lows since bar 81 and re-open the 2358.62-2700.00 range.", "If bars in the 2700.00-2850.00 area begin to overlap with closes near the middle for several bars, the phase would shift from breakout-spike to range/channel."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2438.54", "close_time_ms": 1789639199999, "high": "2447.67", "low": "2437.42", "open": "2444.93", "open_time_ms": 1789635600000, "volume": "1437852.631"}, {"close": "2434.35", "close_time_ms": 1789642799999, "high": "2438.6", "low": "2430.62", "open": "2438.54", "open_time_ms": 1789639200000, "volume": "1608938.654"}, {"close": "2438.84", "close_time_ms": 1789646399999, "high": "2438.84", "low": "2427.28", "open": "2434.35", "open_time_ms": 1789642800000, "volume": "2000682.265"}, {"close": "2459.02", "close_time_ms": 1789649999999, "high": "2473.3", "low": "2438.5", "open": "2438.59", "open_time_ms": 1789646400000, "volume": "2142684.217"}, {"close": "2460", "close_time_ms": 1789653599999, "high": "2463.35", "low": "2